t /BASE/sales/презентация-о-себе.html\n\nLet me write the first chunk: DOCTYPE, head, CSS, and the opening of body with slide 1.\n\nLet me be thoughtful about the CSS to make it look polished:\n- Font: system font stack\n- Background: gradient\n- Cards with subtle glassmorphism\n- Smooth transitions between slides\n- Nice slide numbers\n\nLet me write it now.\n\nFor the slide transition, I'll use a simple approach: only one slide visible at a time, with a fade/slide transition.\n\nLet me code:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ru\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>ИИ-агент WORK — знакомство</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\n  :root {\n    --bg1:#0f0c29; --bg2:#302b63; --bg3:#24243e;\n    --accent:#7c6cff; --accent2:#00d4ff;\n    --text:#f5f5fa; --muted:#b8b5d0;\n    --card:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    --card-border:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n  }\n  html,body { height:100%; }\n  body {\n    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2),var(--bg3));\n    color:var(--text);\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .deck { position:relative; width:100vw; height:100vh; }\n  .slide {\n    position:absolute; inset:0;\n    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;\n    padding:6vh 8vw;\n    opacity:0; visibility:hidden;\n    transform:translateX(40px);\n    transition:opacity .5s ease, transform .5s ease, visibility .5s;\n  }\n  .slide.active { opacity:1; visibility:visible; transform:translateX(0); }\n  ...\n</style>\n```\n\nLet me continue with the full design. I'll write it all out.\n\nLet me think about slide content layout. Each slide has:\n- A small kicker/label (e.g., \"01 · Кто я\")\n- A big title\n- Content (list, grid of cards, etc.)\n\nLet me make a consistent structure.\n\nI'll write the whole thing. Let me be efficient and write it in 2-3 chunks.\n\nLet me draft the full HTML mentally and then write it.\n\nGiven the length, I'll write:\n- Chunk 1 (write): head + CSS + body open + slides 1-3\n- Chunk 2 (append): slides 4-7\n- Chunk 3 (append): slides 8-10 + nav + JS + close\n\nLet me write chunk 1.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the save location. The task place is /BASE/sales «Продажи». A presentation about myself is a bit odd to put in a sales folder, but it's where the task is. I'll save it there. That's fine.\n\nLet me write it now. I'll make the content accurate and the design polished.\n\nLet me write the CSS to be really nice. I'll include:\n- Kicker style\n- Title style\n- Subtitle\n- Card grid\n- List items with icons (using emoji or simple markers)\n- Footer with slide number and progress\n\nLet me go.\n\nFor icons, I'll use emoji to keep it simple and self-contained (no external resources).\n\nLet me write chunk 1 now.\n",
